OLD WOUNDS. 

THE 9TH GUARDS HAVE BEEN GIVEN OPERATIONAL CHARGE OF BRAVO 
SECTOR. UTILIZING 1ST AND 2ND TROOPS, COMMAND HAS ORDERED 
THE RAPID ELIMINATION OF MLF FIELD COMMAND HEADQUARTERS. 

ASSUMING A COURSE HEADING OF 325ø N/NW, 1ST TROOP HAS BEEN 
ORDERED TO PROCEED INTO THE MLF AREA OF OPERATIONS. YOUR 
DESIGNATED TARGET IS THE FIELD COMMAND HEADQUARTERS THE 
AMERICANS HAVE ESTABLISHED IN BRAVO SECTOR. 

2ND TRP HAS BEEN ORDERED TO PROCEED ON A COURSE HEADING OF 334ø 
N/NW. 2ND TROOP'S PRIMARY OBJECTIVE WILL BE AS SECURITY FOR 
1ST TROOP, CLEARING THE FIELD OF ENEMY UNITS.

HOWEVER, SHOULD 1ST TROOP FIND ITSELF UNABLE TO COMPLETE ITS 
MISSION 2ND TROOP IS AUTHORIZED TO NEUTRALIZE ENEMY FIELD HQ AT 
BRAVO SECTOR.
